WEBVTT

00:01:28.334 --> 00:01:31.504
And yet, we can examine
aspects of the self

00:01:31.546 --> 00:01:33.131
that seem real to us,

00:01:33.881 --> 00:01:36.050
and ask, “Just how real are they?”

00:01:38.553 --> 00:01:41.097
Take, for instance,
the question "Who am I?"

00:01:42.265 --> 00:01:47.562
The most likely answer you will get
or give to such a question

00:01:47.603 --> 00:01:49.689
will be in the form of a story.

00:01:50.898 --> 00:01:54.819
We tell others -- and indeed, ourselves --
stories about who we are.

00:01:54.819 --> 00:01:56.737
We take our stories to be sacrosanct.

00:01:56.779 --> 00:01:58.281
We are our stories.